  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00001",
      "text": "Trinidad and Tobago is known the world over as the birthplace of calypso music and a key aspect of the genre is “extempo”. Short for “extemporaneous”, this lyrically improvisational form of calypso — which typically involves live contests in which performers spontaneously invent lyrics around given themes — is both popular and entertaining, due in some measure to the biting picong between the combatants of these extempo wars.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 429,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calypso_music",
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extempo",
        "https://globalvoices.org/2019/01/30/the-beef-between-two-trinidad-and-tobago-soca-stars-is-a-nod-to-age-old-musical-traditions/",
        "https://sites.google.com/site/musicoftrinidadcarnival/types-of-music/extempo"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00002",
      "text": "Such interactive performances typically include spectators echoing one of a number of refrains, the most common of which is santimanitay!, a derivative of the French phrase sans humanité (“without mercy”).",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 431,
      "body_end": 636,
      "source_links": [
        "https://triniinxisle.com/2019/04/21/trini-phrase-of-the-week-santimanitay/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00003",
      "text": "In the midst of the coronavirus pandemic, many Caribbean netizens — as well as members of the diaspora — have heeded the call of Trinidad and Tobago's reigning Extempo Monarch, Brian London, to try their lyrical prowess in a COVID-19 extempo challenge. Ian Webster, three-time holder of Barbados’ Calypso King title, also claimed credit for starting the trend — but regardless of who issued the initial clarion call, the riposte was phenomenal.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 638,
      "body_end": 1082,
      "source_links": [
        "http://cropover.nationnews.com/crop-over/news/99413/iweb-calypso-king",
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extempo_Monarch",
        "https://www.facebook.com/1447053148908724/videos/218174989509929/",
        "https://www.facebook.com/lisa.bento.31/posts/10157174724417776",
        "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=2269894699973220",
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ty4jc-HrJcI",
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMxMealPfEQ"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00004",
      "text": "Among the “first responders” were three-time Junior Extempo Monarch, Kevan Calliste, who would certainly appreciate that extempo, being a competitive sport of sorts, is ultimately judged by the inventiveness of the lyrics, and the poise and confidence with which they are delivered.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 1084,
      "body_end": 1366,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/192696260772574/videos/2269894699973220/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00005",
      "text": "Some of the best offerings included Trinidad and Tobago's current Calypso Monarch, Terri Lyons, who urged Facebook users to “stay at home…don't go and roam”:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 1368,
      "body_end": 1525,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/robert.ellington.5/posts/10158368922656520"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00006",
      "text": "> On a serious note 'bout this COVID-19",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 1527,
      "body_end": 1566,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00007",
      "text": "> You have to wash your hands and practice proper hygiene",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 1568,
      "body_end": 1625,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00008",
      "text": "> And social distancing will make corona subside",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1627,
      "body_end": 1675,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00009",
      "text": "> So please comply and keep your ass inside",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1677,
      "body_end": 1720,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00010",
      "text": "Lyons took the opportunity to challenge some of her peers, including former Calypso Queen of Trinidad and Tobago, Heather MacIntosh, who readily jumped in via YouTube:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1722,
      "body_end": 1889,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6j1ptyFGo6c"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00011",
      "text": "> The government trying the best they can to pound some sense into citizens",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 1891,
      "body_end": 1966,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00012",
      "text": "> Man, every day they on the TV, asking, begging, pleading with we",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 1968,
      "body_end": 2034,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00013",
      "text": "> Distance yourself, help flatten the curve; do them simple things your nation to serve",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 2036,
      "body_end": 2123,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00014",
      "text": "> Now I adding my voice, telling John Public, ‘Stay home, stay safe and please don't get sick…’",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 2125,
      "body_end": 2220,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00015",
      "text": "On YouTube, Grenadian singer Jermaine Simon warned that the coronavirus does not discriminate, so everyone should strive to self-isolate:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 2222,
      "body_end": 2359,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tMbiAAJ5y5Y"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00016",
      "text": "> I sit home listening to the news thinking",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 2361,
      "body_end": 2404,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00017",
      "text": "> ‘Bout the deadly virus COVID-19",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "body_start": 2406,
      "body_end": 2439,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00018",
      "text": "> Sad, a lot of people dead and they gone",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "body_start": 2441,
      "body_end": 2482,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00019",
      "text": "> The rich, the old, the poor and the young…",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "body_start": 2484,
      "body_end": 2528,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00020",
      "text": "In fact, several singers from Grenada got together to do the challenge and send a strong message to the public about how their behaviour can help stop the spread of the virus.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 20,
      "body_start": 2530,
      "body_end": 2705,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_cFZZy0BXM0"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00021",
      "text": "St. Lucian musician Arthur Allain also contributed, causing the country's prime minister, Allen Chastanet, to call him a “true patriot and ambassador”. His tune included these lyrics:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "body_start": 2707,
      "body_end": 2890,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/1409638192624686/videos/524120791622308/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00022",
      "text": "> Ladies and gentlemen, the message now is clear",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "body_start": 2892,
      "body_end": 2940,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00023",
      "text": "> Corona is serious but have no fear",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 23,
      "body_start": 2942,
      "body_end": 2978,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00024",
      "text": "> We can win this war, yeah, we can win with ease",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 24,
      "body_start": 2980,
      "body_end": 3029,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00025",
      "text": "> All we ask is that you kindly stay at home please…",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 25,
      "body_start": 3031,
      "body_end": 3083,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00026",
      "text": "Of course, not everyone who participated was a professional singer, but many had musical talent, like Trinidadian Facebook user Sonja Tee, who sang:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 26,
      "body_start": 3085,
      "body_end": 3233,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/sonja.teelucksingh/posts/10158661118369245"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00027",
      "text": "> These are strange times and you know it's true",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 27,
      "body_start": 3235,
      "body_end": 3283,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00028",
      "text": "> COVID-19 has changed everything that we do",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 28,
      "body_start": 3285,
      "body_end": 3329,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00029",
      "text": "> We were living our lives with normality, going to work, visiting friends and family",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 29,
      "body_start": 3331,
      "body_end": 3416,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00030",
      "text": "> We thought that those times would forever last",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 30,
      "body_start": 3418,
      "body_end": 3466,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00031",
      "text": "> But this global crisis put that in the past…",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 31,
      "body_start": 3468,
      "body_end": 3514,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00032",
      "text": "This unnamed man from Dominica also offered a worthwhile contribution:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 32,
      "body_start": 3516,
      "body_end": 3586,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bNw-m5BcNSk"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00033",
      "text": "> Well, I say it must be a curse, this COVID-19 virus",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 33,
      "body_start": 3588,
      "body_end": 3641,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00034",
      "text": "> And it taking over the world, every man, woman, boy and girl",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 34,
      "body_start": 3643,
      "body_end": 3705,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00035",
      "text": "> It affecting every country, cripple the world economy",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 35,
      "body_start": 3707,
      "body_end": 3762,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00036",
      "text": "> Everybody now search their soul, I say Jah taking back control…",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 36,
      "body_start": 3764,
      "body_end": 3829,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00037",
      "text": "Three generations of the Caribbean diaspora, two of whom are health care workers, also teamed up to do the challenge. The video was widely shared via WhatsApp:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 37,
      "body_start": 3831,
      "body_end": 3990,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00038",
      "text": "> As nurses in the USA, this is what we would like to say:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 38,
      "body_start": 3992,
      "body_end": 4050,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00039",
      "text": "> Coronavirus, ah telling you, man, we don't think that USA has a plan",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 39,
      "body_start": 4052,
      "body_end": 4122,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00040",
      "text": "> But we will fight through and through, stay in your house I'm telling you",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 40,
      "body_start": 4124,
      "body_end": 4199,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00041",
      "text": "> Wash your hands, wear a mask, and don't get corona up in your ass",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 41,
      "body_start": 4201,
      "body_end": 4268,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00042",
      "text": "Delivering a serious message with a tinge of humour, ambassador and former member of parliament in Trinidad and Tobago, Amery Browne, had the last word:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 42,
      "body_start": 4270,
      "body_end": 4422,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/amery.browne/videos/10221965364268087/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00043",
      "text": "> Some turn to science, some start to pray, some in the supermarket all day",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 43,
      "body_start": 4424,
      "body_end": 4499,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00044",
      "text": "> Some spraying Lysol under their shoe, some buy out all the toilet tissue",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 44,
      "body_start": 4501,
      "body_end": 4575,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00045",
      "text": "> But from the facts we cannot hide, our social distancing must be wide",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 45,
      "body_start": 4577,
      "body_end": 4648,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00046",
      "text": "> So listen to me, swallow your pride, my friend — keep your tail inside",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 46,
      "body_start": 4650,
      "body_end": 4722,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-703980-b00047",
      "text": "Santimanitay!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 47,
      "body_start": 4724,
      "body_end": 4737,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
